5. Test method
Application checks run with Python; network checks run in Ubuntu with Mininet, Open vSwitch, and OS-Ken. The D2 comparison uses normal and link-failure scenarios. `pingall` checks host reachability, worker logs verify registration, and the benchmark polls each job’s final status and writes one CSV row per submitted job.
